esign. Lose yourself in the beauty of the city as you live out the perfect European fantasy, wandering ancient cobblestone streets, indulging in luxurious high-end shopping, and gazing upon magnificent historic monuments.","location_subheading":"Italy","price":272,"original_price":272,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000CuiRfAAJ","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/c0y00fn5ldwjenvsp7cd","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/hk1wn4c4t4gflx3azs8","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/e429eg81y92iy5jaif","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 01:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Crowne Plaza Milan Linate","offer_country_name":"Italy","location_heading":"Milan","title":"Elegant Milan Retreat within Italy's Fashion Capital","description":"Live your Italian dream and step into a world of fashion, culture and gourmet cuisine at Crowne Plaza Milan - Linate, an IHG Hotel. A fast-paced metropolis home to some of the world's most influential fashion houses, Milan allows you to indulge in opulent retail therapy, dine in Michelin-starred restaurants and wander through amazing sights that encapsulate the city's rich history. Shop 'til you drop, then return to the hotel and sip mouthwatering Italian wines at the onsite Il Giardino restaurant.","location_subheading":"Italy","price":96,"original_price":96,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000CQJaHAAX","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/330erc5c7pre1z9ihf4","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/d8enaizcir3bepeztjh","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/56szqs66x9jc0ne88ef","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Aethos Milan","offer_country_name":"Italy","location_heading":"Milan","title":"Boutique Milan Designer Suites in Renowned Navigli District","description":"Experience high-end opulence and refreshing indulgence at the boutique Aethos Milan. Ideally located in the heart of Milan, within walking distance of the Columns of St. Lawrence, Arco di Porta Ticinese and Navigli Milano, Aethos Milan offers an eclectic mix of artistic elegance and modern comforts, while maintaining impeccable hospitality and authentic Italian style. Each of its picturesque suites offers an industrial aesthetic softened by swathes of warm orange and yellow and handpicked design features. Inside, guests can whet their appetite with tantalizing classic Italian flavors at ZAÏA Restaurant, or settle in with a reinvented cocktail at The Doping Bar - known for its dynamic menu featuring local herbs, botanicals and homemade spirits. Once you've had your fill, hit the city streets and visit the iconic sites nearby, or hop on a train at Milano Centrale Railway Station to explore further afield.","location_subheading":"Italy","price":213,"original_price":213,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000008mzVKAAY","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/kaj4xni2qya76r3pgi8","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/asfhc8m3at9ccq5b1kt","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/l1m2z5yccjiovp6l9g","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"}],"lang":"en"}]}]
